<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <div style="background: #f4f4f4; padding: 30px; border-radius: 10px;">
    <h2 style="color: #2c3e50;">Welcome to {{appName}}!</h2>
    <p>Hello {{fullName}},</p>
    <p>Your account has been created successfully. You can now log in and start using our platform.</p>
    <a href="{{loginUrl}}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background: #3498db; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; margin: 10px 0;">Login Now</a>
    <p>If you did not create this account, please ignore this email.</p>
    <p>Best regards,<br>The {{appName}} Team</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>